WEBVTT

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:00.546
can reduce that overreactivity
of the amygdala

00:05:00.588 --> 00:05:02.631
we see an anxiety disorders.

00:05:02.673 --> 00:05:04.592
High blood pressure and diabetes,

00:05:04.633 --> 00:05:06.969
they can be treated or managed over time.

00:05:06.969 --> 00:05:10.139
And the same is true
for an anxiety disorder too.